\begin{frame}{Materials/Phases}
\begin{itemize}
\item One phase is discontinuous, stiffer and stronger, and is called the
\textbf{reinforcement}.
\item The other phase is continuous, less stiff and weaker, and is called the
\textbf{matrix}.
\end{itemize}
